{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a Shopify OS 2.0 Featured Product Listing section. Focus only on the visual design. Do not add any slider or functionality yet.
    
    The section should look like a premium ecommerce product listing similar to top D2C brands.
    
    Layout
    Full-width section with a white background.
    Large centered heading "BEST SELLERS" using the Anton font.
    Heading should be bold, uppercase, and around 60–70px on desktop.
    Keep the spacing between the heading and product cards very small.
    Product Grid
    
    Display 4 product cards in one row on desktop.
    
    The cards should be:
    
    White background
    Thin light-grey border
    Small border radius (6–8px)
    Premium clean look
    Equal width and height
    Consistent spacing between cards
    Product Card Layout
    
    The layout inside every card should follow exactly this order:
    
    Product Image
    Rating & Review Count
    Product Title
    Price Row
    Offer Badge (optional)
    Add to Cart Button
    Product Image
    
    The product image is the hero element.
    
    Requirements:
    
    Occupy about 65% of the card height.
    Large image.
    Perfectly centered.
    Never crop the product.
    Never zoom.
    Keep original aspect ratio using object-fit: contain.
    Fixed image container so every card has identical image height.
    Product Title
    Center aligned.
    Maximum 2 lines.
    Bold.
    Anton font.
    Equal height on every card.
    Price
    
    Display on one line:
    
    Compare-at price (grey, struck through)
    Sale price (large and bold)
    Discount percentage (green)
    
    Everything aligned horizontally.
    
    Offer Badge
    
    Optional rounded pill below the price.
    
    Add to Cart Button
    Full width.
    Fixed at the bottom.
    Same height on every card.
    Crimson red background.
    White Anton text.
    Important
    
    Do not redesign this section in your own style.
    
    Avoid oversized white spaces.
    
    The product image must dominate the card.
    
    The content must be compact below the image.
    
    Every card must have identical proportions and look like a professional ecommerce product listing rather than a generic Shopify card.
    
    Only build the visual layout. Do not add carousel functionality, animations, scrolling, navigation, or JavaScript yet.
    
    This prompt is intentionally short because Shopify AI tends to produce much better UI when it's only responsible for the layout. Once you're happy with the design, I'll give you Part 2, which will add:
    
    Horizontal carousel
    Touchpad drag
    Mouse drag
    Mobile swipe
    Navigation arrows
    AJAX Add to Cart
    All Theme Editor settings
    
    without changing the design., The current product card layout is incorrect. Keep the existing section, but rebuild the product card layout to match a professional ecommerce product listing. Do not change the overall section.
    
    Requirements:
    
    Remove the rounded corners from the cards. Use square cards with only a 1px light grey border.
    Remove the large empty white space inside each card.
    Increase the product image size so it occupies 60–65% of the card height.
    Keep the entire product image visible using object-fit: contain. Never crop or stretch the image.
    Center the image at the top of the card.
    
    Rebuild the content below the image in this exact order:
    
    Rating + Review Count (left aligned directly below the image)
    Product Title (left aligned, bold, maximum 2 lines)
    Price Row:
    Compare-at price (grey with strikethrough)
    Sale price (larger and bold)
    Discount percentage (green)
    All on a single line
    Offer Badge (optional, full width)
    Add to Cart Button fixed at the bottom of the card.
    
    Card rules:
    
    Every card must have the same height.
    Every image container must have the same height.
    Every title must reserve the same space (2 lines).
    Every Add to Cart button must align perfectly across all cards.
    Reduce vertical spacing between every element.
    Increase horizontal padding slightly.
    Make the layout compact like a premium Shopify product listing.
    
    Typography:
    
    Product Title: Anton, bold.
    Price: larger than title.
    Compare Price: smaller and grey.
    Discount: green and bold.
    Rating and review count: small and left aligned.
    Add to Cart button: Anton, uppercase.
    
    Do not change the heading, carousel, or functionality. Only rebuild the internal product card layout to look like a premium ecommerce product listing., The current product cards are incorrect. Do not redesign the entire section. Rebuild only the product card layout using a standard Shopify ecommerce product card. Remove the current centered layout completely.
    
    Product Card Layout
    
    Rebuild every card in this exact order:
    
    Product Image
    Rating + Review Count
    Product Title
    Price Row
    Offer Badge
    Add to Cart Button
    Product Image
    Place the product image at the very top of the card.
    The image should occupy approximately 65% of the card height.
    Use a fixed image container.
    Use object-fit: contain.
    Never crop, zoom, or stretch the image.
    Remove all empty white space above the image.
    The image should be centered inside the image container while remaining aligned to the top of the card.
    Rating
    
    Place directly below the image.
    
    Left aligned.
    Show star rating followed by review count.
    Example: ⭐ 4.8 | 120 Reviews
    Product Title
    
    Place directly below the rating.
    
    Requirements:
    
    Left aligned
    Anton font
    Bold
    Maximum 2 lines
    Same reserved height on every card
    Do not vertically center the title
    Price Row
    
    Display everything on one line.
    
    Example:
    
    ₹2,899 ₹2,499 -14% OFF
    
    Requirements:
    
    Compare-at price: grey and strikethrough.
    Sale price: bold and larger.
    Discount: green and bold.
    Offer Badge
    
    Display directly below the price.
    
    Example:
    
    FREE SHIPPING + 3% PREPAID BONUS
    
    Full-width rounded pill.
    
    Add to Cart Button
    
    Place at the very bottom of the card.
    
    Requirements:
    
    Full width
    Crimson red background
    White Anton text
    Same height on every card
    Same bottom spacing on every card
    Card Design
    White background
    Square corners (no border radius)
    1px light grey border
    No shadow
    Compact spacing
    Equal height cards
    Spacing
    
    Reduce all unnecessary white space.
    
    The content should flow naturally from top to bottom.
    
    Nothing should be vertically centered.
    
    Important
    
    Do not use flexbox vertical centering (align-items:center or justify-content:center) for the card layout.
    
    Use a traditional ecommerce structure where the content stacks from top to bottom.
    
    Do not use placeholder or demo card markup. Use Shopify's native product card structure and only restyle it.
    
    The final result should look like a professional Shopify product listing, with the product image at the top, all information below it, and the Add to Cart button fixed at the bottom.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Anton&display=swap');

  .ai-featured-products-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    padding: 40px 20px;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-featured-products-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif;
    font-size: 60px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 0 20px 0;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .ai-featured-products-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-product-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #d0d0d0;
    border-radius: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    position: relative;
    height: 600px;
  }

  .ai-product-image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 380px;
    display: block;
    padding: 0;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-product-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-product-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: #f5f5f5;
  }

  .ai-product-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 60%;
    height: 60%;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .ai-product-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: 12px 16px 16px 16px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .ai-product-rating-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #666666;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .ai-product-stars-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: #ffa500;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .ai-product-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-align: left;
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
    line-height: 1.3;
    display: -webkit-box;
    -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    overflow: hidden;
    height: 42px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .ai-product-price-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    flex-wrap: nowrap;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .ai-product-compare-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #999999;
    text-decoration: line-through;
  }

  .ai-product-sale-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #000000;
  }

  .ai-product-discount-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #00a651;
  }

  .ai-product-offer-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: #f0f0f0;
    color: #333333;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    width: 100%;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .ai-product-add-to-cart-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: #dc143c;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 0;
    padding: 14px 20px;
    cursor: pointer;
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: auto;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .ai-product-add-to-cart-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: #b8112f;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 1200px) {
    .ai-featured-products-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
    .ai-featured-products-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 40px;
    }

    .ai-featured-products-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .ai-product-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      height: 480px;
    }

    .ai-product-image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      height: 280px;
    }

    .ai-product-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 14px;
      height: 38px;
    }

    .ai-product-sale-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .ai-product-add-to-cart-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 13px;
      padding: 12px 16px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 480px) {
    .ai-featured-products-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 32px;
    }

    .ai-featured-products-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .ai-product-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      height: auto;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-featured-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <h2 class="ai-featured-products-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h2>

  <div class="ai-featured-products-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.collection != blank %}
      {% for product in block.settings.collection.products limit: 4 %}
        <div class="ai-product-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-product-image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if product.featured_image %}
              <img
                src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 600 }}"
                alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | escape }}"
                class="ai-product-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                loading="lazy"
                width="600"
                height="600"
              >
            {% else %}
              <div class="ai-product-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>

          <div class="ai-product-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.show_ratings %}
              <div class="ai-product-rating-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <span class="ai-product-stars-{{ ai_gen_id }}">⭐</span>
                <span>{{ block.settings.rating_value }} | {{ block.settings.review_count }} Reviews</span>
              </div>
            {% endif %}

            <h3 class="ai-product-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ product.title }}</h3>

            <div class="ai-product-price-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% if product.compare_at_price > product.price %}
                <span class="ai-product-compare-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ product.compare_at_price | money }}</span>
                <span class="ai-product-sale-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ product.price | money }}</span>
                {% assign discount = product.compare_at_price | minus: product.price | times: 100 | divided_by: product.compare_at_price %}
                <span class="ai-product-discount-{{ ai_gen_id }}">-{{ discount }}% OFF</span>
              {% else %}
                <span class="ai-product-sale-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ product.price | money }}</span>
              {% endif %}
            </div>

            {% if block.settings.offer_text != blank %}
              <div class="ai-product-offer-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.offer_text }}</div>
            {% endif %}

            <button class="ai-product-add-to-cart-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.button_text }}
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    {% else %}
      {% for i in (1..4) %}
        <div class="ai-product-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-product-image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-product-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="ai-product-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.show_ratings %}
              <div class="ai-product-rating-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <span class="ai-product-stars-{{ ai_gen_id }}">⭐</span>
                <span>{{ block.settings.rating_value }} | {{ block.settings.review_count }} Reviews</span>
              </div>
            {% endif %}

            <h3 class="ai-product-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">SAMPLE PRODUCT TITLE HERE</h3>

            <div class="ai-product-price-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <span class="ai-product-compare-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">₹2,899</span>
              <span class="ai-product-sale-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">₹2,499</span>
              <span class="ai-product-discount-{{ ai_gen_id }}">-14% OFF</span>
            </div>

            {% if block.settings.offer_text != blank %}
              <div class="ai-product-offer-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.offer_text }}</div>
            {% endif %}

            <button class="ai-product-add-to-cart-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.button_text }}
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Featured products",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "BEST SELLERS"
    },
    {
      "type": "collection",
      "id": "collection",
      "label": "Collection"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Ratings"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_ratings",
      "label": "Show ratings",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "rating_value",
      "label": "Rating value",
      "default": "4.8"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "review_count",
      "label": "Review count",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 1000,
      "step": 10,
      "default": 120
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Offer badge"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "offer_text",
      "label": "Offer text",
      "default": "FREE SHIPPING + 3% PREPAID BONUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Button"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "button_text",
      "label": "Button text",
      "default": "ADD TO CART"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Featured products"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
